All numerical claims in the main manuscript and in this supplement are
computed from result tables produced by the AOM-PLS, AOM-Ridge,
classification and FastAOM runners.  The aggregation scripts regenerate the
paired statistics, tables and matplotlib figures from those result tables.

\section{AI-Assistance Statement}

AI assistance was used to draft explanatory text and to generate
manuscript-support scripts for aggregation, paired statistics and figure
generation.  Every numerical claim in the main manuscript and in this
supplement is computed from benchmark result tables; the assistance did not
generate numerical results by itself.  The authors remain responsible for the
study design, data interpretation, code review and final text.

