+(simple), implemented as \texttt{AOMRidge-global-compact-none}, is much
+lighter, with median fit time 21.60 s and 450 operator-alpha cells.  The
+result is not that every AOM selector is instant; it is that strict-linear
+preprocessing can be represented as a model geometry rather than as a blind
+external pipeline loop.
 
