PLS-default, it reaches a median RMSEP ratio of 0.996 on $N=52$ datasets with
32/52 wins.  Against the completed PLS-HPO subset, it is near parity, with a
median ratio of 0.990 on $N=32$ and 19/32 wins.  This row has no ASLS branch

