\section{Cohort Manifest}

The refreshed manifest contains 61 regression rows and 17 classification rows.
One classification row is excluded from the AOM-PLS-DA paired analysis because
the expected train/test file names differ from the local runner convention, but
its dimensions are derived from the available calibration/validation CSV files
for the cohort overview.  QUARTZ is retained in absolute-error diagnostics but
excluded from pairwise ratios because its reference denominator is near zero.
The full cartesian-HPO subset is smaller because some datasets exceeded the
compute budget or failed estimator checks.

