 Data and code availability
The public software entry point is nirs4all at https://github.com/GBeurier/nirs4all.
The experiment code for this paper will be released upon publication at https://github.com/
gbeurier/aom. A portable PLS / NIRS engine with stable C ABI and first-class bindings
for Python, R, MATLAB, JavaScript/WebAssembly and Android will be released at https:
//github.com/gbeurier/pls4all.
    The reproducibility protocol is defined by the cohort denominators in Section 5, the fold-local
model-selection rules in the Methods, and paired dataset-level tests with Holm correction for
the reported families of comparisons. The supplementary material gives the full cohort manifest,
