    All numerical claims in the main manuscript and in this supplement are computed from
benchmark result tables produced by the public repositories announced in the main manuscript.
The regression cohort contains 61 manifest rows; QUARTZ-style near-zero denominators are
retained for absolute-error diagnostics but excluded from ratio tests. The classification cohort
contains 17 manifest rows, with one row excluded from the AOM-PLS-DA paired analysis because
the expected train/test file names differ from the benchmark runner convention. Completed
cartesian-HPO overlaps are 36 PLS datasets and 35 Ridge datasets.
